# Show file names under tiles (MFC-134): the setting hides the name line at once and brings it back.
window 1400x900
command view.theme-light
library sample
wait-for idle
shot 01-names-on
setting appearance.showFileNames false
wait 300ms
shot 02-names-off
setting appearance.showFileNames true
wait 300ms
shot 03-names-back
